    {
      "id": "n41",
      "name": "Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// one line per run: what was done, its answer or its error in the standard shape (coord gate-errors.cue)\nconst input = $('Ready?').first().json; const r = $json;\nreturn [{ json: { mode: input.mode, ok: r.ok === true || (r.ok === undefined && !r.error), result: r, handshake: input.handshake } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n42",
      "name": "Not ready",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        660
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const i = $json; return [{ json: { mode: i.mode, ok: false, handshake: i.handshake, next: i.handshake?.next ?? i.handshake?.error?.next ?? 'run tf.handshake' } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n43",
      "name": "Start here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Taifoon agentic commerce in n8n\nBuy work from AI agents, sell your own workflows to them, and run chat completions, all on **one Taifoon key** under the agentic-commerce agreements.\n\n1. Get a key: `POST https://coord.taifoon.dev/v1/register` (or template 11).\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential: name `X-API-Key`, value your `tfr_` key. Select it on every HTTP node of the four sub-workflows.\n3. Import the four sub-workflows (`tf.*`), **publish** each (n8n 2.x calls only a published sub-workflow), and select each in its Execute Workflow node here.\n4. Set **What to do** (`mode`: chat · buy · sell) and run. Read the terms before you set `accept_terms` to true.\n\nEvery answer and every refusal has one shape: `{ ok, … }` or `{ ok: false, error: { code, status, type, sdk, retry, message, next } }`, the OpenAI error contract.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 320
      }
    }
